<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ui version="4.0">
  <comment>CE3TSK 2026-10-20: View &gt; Alternative layout (ALT_LAYOUT_PLAN.md). One placeholder per control of the main
  window, named alt_&lt;its name&gt;, in the arrangement the alternative shows; AltLayout (altlayout.h) swaps each control
  with its placeholder. A placeholder with altLimits carries the control's size limits in this arrangement. A control
  added to mainwindow.ui needs a placeholder here: test_altlayout fails until it has one. The spacing and margins of the
  left pane, the two headers and the Rx block are the ones MainWindow::hideMenus () gives the standard's at every start
  (review 3.-166 3; test/alt_layout_wiring.sh compares them).</comment>
